                    <h3 class="industry-card-title">Higher Brand Awareness</h3>
                    <div class="industry-card-hover-details">
                        <p class="industry-card-desc">TikTok puts your brand in front of a huge audience quickly. A single well-made video can reach thousands of new people without extra ad spend. More views mean more people who know your name. Over time, this builds recall and trust, which lowers the cost of winning each new customer.</p>
