                    <h3 class="industry-card-title">Lower Cost Per Lead</h3>
                     
                    <div class="industry-card-hover-details">
                        <p class="industry-card-desc">TikTok lets you start with a small budget and test different ads. You can see which videos bring the best results and put more money behind them. This means less wasted spend. Businesses often get leads at a lower cost than on other paid platforms.</p>
